OL,5,G0930 Essential Classics
OL,6,     FGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,7,     Fclassical music, with discoveries
OL,8,     Fand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,9,     Fwith familiar favourites.
OL,10,G1300 Classical Live
OL,11,     FElizabeth Alker showcases the best
OL,12,     Fperformances from the UK and
OL,13,     Fbeyond, including Mozart's
OL,14,     FSinfonia concertante in Eb major
OL,15,     FK.364 and Schumann's Kerner-Lieder
OL,16,     FOp.35.
OL,17,G1600 Composer of the Week: Leonard
OL,18,G     Bernstein
OL,19,     F2/5. Donald Macleod explores
OL,20,     FBernstein's meteoric rise to fame
OL,21,     Fas a conductor and a composer as
OL,22,     FAmerica goes to war.
